      "output": "I pulled the live data for your docs site and built a dashboard around it. Here's what I found:\n\n**`docs.example.dev`** — 12,480 pageviews across 3,912 visitors over 5,207 visits. Peak traffic is on **2026-11-05** (2,011 pageviews), with the 2026-11-03 → 11-05 trend climbing steadily. The `copy-snippet` event is your only tracked interaction at 512 fires, and the only session sample available is US / Firefox.\n\nThe dashboard below is a single self-contained file with the trend, sessions, and event data rendered as inline SVG.\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>docs.example.dev — Analytics</title>\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --bg:#0a0a0a; --panel:#111111; --panel-2:#161616;\n    --line:#262626; --line-soft:#1c1c1c;\n    --text:#f2f2f2; --muted:#8a8a8a; --dim:#5c5c5c;\n    --accent:#ffffff; --accent-soft:#ffffff1a;\n    --pos:#ffffff; --neg:#ff5c5c;\n    --mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\n  body{\n    background:var(--bg); color:var(--text);\n    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  }\n  .wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 24px 64px}\n\n  /* header */\n  header{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:28px}\n  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n  .mark{width:30px;height:30px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--panel)}\n  .mark svg{display:block}\n  .brand h1{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n  .brand .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}\n  .site-select{\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;\n    padding:7px 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;\n    transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;\n  }\n  .site-select:hover{border-color:#3a3a3a;background:var(--panel-2)}\n  .site-select .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}\n  .site-select .lbl{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}\n\n  /* nav */\n  nav{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-bottom:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  nav button{\n    background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);font:inherit;font-size:13px;\n    padding:8px 14px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s,background .15s;\n  }\n  nav button:hover{color:var(--text);background:var(--panel)}\n  nav button.active{color:var(--text);background:var(--panel);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line)}\n\n  /* panels */\n  .grid{display:grid;gap:14px}\n  .g-stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}\n  .g-main{grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr}\n  .g-bottom{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n  .g-rows{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}\n\n  .panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 18px 16px}\n  .panel-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}\n  .panel-head h2{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.01em}\n  .panel-head .hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim)}\n  .panel-head .right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n\n  .stat .num{font-size:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .stat .num small{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;margin-left:3px}\n  .stat .lbl{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\n  .stat .delta{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}\n  .stat .delta .up{color:var(--pos)}\n  .stat .delta .down{color:var(--neg)}\n\n  /* chart */\n  .chart{width:100%;overflow:visible}\n  .chart svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible}\n  .axis{stroke:var(--line-soft);stroke-width:1}\n  .gridline{stroke"
